    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5130" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμελέτ-ητος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unpractised, unprepared,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					172a
				</span></i>
			: c. inf., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἐν ταῖς ἡδοναῖς καρτερεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					635c
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Procop.
				<u>Goth.</u>
				1.9
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινός, πρός τι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Cont.</u>
				7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Tox.</u>
				29
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>SE</u>
				175a26
			</span></i>: abs. of horses, <i>untrained,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Eq.Mag.</u>
				1.19
			</span></i>, al. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως, ἔχειν τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Or.</u>
					1.2d
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως, ἔχειν</span> to be <i>unprepared,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				173c
			</span></i>.</div>
